WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.387
Not bad.
不错

00:00:04.431 --> 00:00:06.868
What about you?
Any evil talents?
你呢？有任何邪恶才能？

00:00:06.911 --> 00:00:09.305
Uh-- Bello!
你呢？有任何邪恶才能？

00:00:09.348 --> 00:00:11.350
♪ La, la, la
La, la, la ♪

00:00:11.394 --> 00:00:14.615
Eh?That's not evil or a talent.
那即不邪恶也不算才能

00:00:14.658 --> 00:00:16.573
[ Grunts ]

00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:20.664
[ Scissors Snipping ]♪♪ [ Humming ]

00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:24.886
Bello!
[ Growls ]

00:00:24.929 --> 00:00:27.715
[ Chuckles ]
No? ♪♪ [ Ends ]

00:00:27.758 --> 00:00:31.327
I'm sorry.
But I'm not looking
for any more servants.
抱歉！我没要聘请仆从…

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:37.072
For I, Professor Flux,
have invented the world's
first time machine!
我，佛史博士
已成功研发首个时光机！

00:00:37.115 --> 00:00:39.509
Every time
I visit the future,
我每次都把未来的自己带回来

00:00:39.553 --> 00:00:43.557
I bring my future self
back to help me.
我每次都把未来的自己带回来

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.385
- Hello!
- Oh.
你好！

00:00:46.429 --> 00:00:49.563
Move that over there,
Professor Flux
from two weeks from now.
把这个移走，未来两周的佛史博士

00:00:49.606 --> 00:00:52.566
[ Groans ]
As you can see,
I don't need any help.
如你所见，我不缺人手

00:00:52.609 --> 00:00:54.916
[ Croaks ]

00:00:54.959 --> 00:00:57.092
Oh, way to go, guys.
糟了，我们杀了原版的博士！

00:00:57.135 --> 00:01:00.269
We killed the original.
[ Gasps ]
糟了，我们杀了原版的博士！

00:01:00.312 --> 00:01:02.880
[ Clones Screaming ]

00:01:02.924 --> 00:01:04.447
Please!
拜托！

00:01:04.491 --> 00:01:06.928
Eh--

00:01:06.971 --> 00:01:10.192
[ Minionese ] [ Announcer ] Villain-Con
presents our keynote speaker,
欢迎恶人博览会的首席演讲人…

00:01:10.235 --> 00:01:13.064
Scarlet Overkill!
女魔头斯嘉丽杀人狂！

00:01:13.108 --> 00:01:15.763
The world's first
female super villain!
世上首位女性超级恶人！

00:01:15.806 --> 00:01:18.983
[ Stammering ]
Stuart! Appearing right now...
就在第一大讲堂！

00:01:19.027 --> 00:01:20.942
in Hall "H"!Buddies! Hey, buddies!
就在第一大讲堂！

00:01:20.985 --> 00:01:22.900
[ Minionese ]
Scarlet Popapil!Scarlet?

00:01:22.944 --> 00:01:25.729
[ Minionese ]Kevin!
女魔头斯嘉丽杀人狂

00:01:25.773 --> 00:01:29.559
Are you ready--[ Cheering ]
你们准备好迎接…

00:01:29.603 --> 00:01:31.605
Yeah![ Minionese ]
女魔头斯嘉丽杀人狂！

00:01:31.648 --> 00:01:35.522
for Scarlet Overkill?
女魔头斯嘉丽杀人狂！

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:42.311
[ Scarlet Sighs ]
Doesn't it feel so good
to be bad?
邪恶的感觉真好对吗？

00:01:42.354 --> 00:01:43.791
Scarlet! Scarlet!
Scarlet!Yes!
-斯嘉丽！斯嘉丽！斯嘉丽！
-是的！

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:47.142
Whoo! Whoo!
Whoo! Whoo!
-斯嘉丽！斯嘉丽！斯嘉丽！
-是的！

00:01:49.013 --> 00:01:50.580
[ Cackling ]

00:01:50.624 --> 00:01:51.929
[ Together ]
Whoa.

00:01:51.973 --> 00:01:54.323
Ahh.

00:01:56.412 --> 00:01:57.587
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:59.154 --> 00:02:00.547
[ Grunts ]

00:02:08.772 --> 00:02:12.080
Yeah![ Minionese ]

00:02:12.123 --> 00:02:14.125
Oh, wow!
哇！谢谢！

00:02:14.169 --> 00:02:16.867
Thank you!
[ Chuckles ]
斯嘉丽! 斯嘉丽!

00:02:16.911 --> 00:02:19.261
[ Crowd Chanting ]
Scarlet! Scarlet!Thank you so much!
很感谢大家！

00:02:20.088 --> 00:02:21.655
Okay. Shh!
好了

00:02:21.698 --> 00:02:23.308
Shh, shh, shh!

00:02:23.352 --> 00:02:24.701
Ahh.

00:02:24.745 --> 00:02:27.661
When I started out,
people said a woman...
我刚出道时，人们都说
女人无法超越男人打劫！

00:02:27.704 --> 00:02:30.620
could never rob a bank
as well as a man.
我刚出道时，人们都说
女人无法超越男人打劫！

00:02:30.664 --> 00:02:32.709
Well...
我刚出道时，人们都说
女人无法超越男人打劫！

00:02:32.753 --> 00:02:35.190
times change!
时代改变了！

00:02:35.233 --> 00:02:37.714
[ Chuckles ]I love you, Scarlet!
我爱你，斯嘉丽！

00:02:37.758 --> 00:02:40.412
Look at all those
faces out there.
看看在座的各位！

00:02:40.456 --> 00:02:42.719
We are all so different.
我们大不相同！

00:02:42.763 --> 00:02:44.678
But we have one thing
in common.
却有着相同处

00:02:44.721 --> 00:02:48.029
We were born with flippers!
我们都长了脚蹼！

00:02:49.291 --> 00:02:52.337
No? Just me?
就只有我？

00:02:52.381 --> 00:02:53.556
Okay.
好吧

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.515
[ Clears Throat ]
We have big dreams!
我们都抱有伟大的梦想！

00:02:56.559 --> 00:02:59.301
And we will do anything
to make them come true!
而且会不惜代价让美梦成真！

00:02:59.344 --> 00:03:02.478
[ Man ]
Yeah!Have any of you ever dreamt...
你们可否梦想过…

00:03:02.521 --> 00:03:07.178
of working for the greatest
super villain of all time?[ Cheering ]
为首屈一指的超级恶人卖命？

00:03:07.222 --> 00:03:09.267
Yeah! Whoo-hoo![ Chuckles ]

00:03:09.311 --> 00:03:10.965
[ Snickering ]

00:03:11.008 --> 00:03:14.011
Well, what if I were
to tell you...
让我告诉你…

00:03:14.055 --> 00:03:17.667
that Iam looking
for new henchmen?
我正在聘请仆从

00:03:17.711 --> 00:03:21.062
[ Minionese ]
Big boss! Sí!

00:03:21.105 --> 00:03:24.413
I truly believe
somewhere out there...
我确信在世上的某处…

00:03:24.456 --> 00:03:28.330
is a villain with the potential
to serve greatness!
有人能为首席恶人效劳！

00:03:28.373 --> 00:03:31.028
And it could be any of you.
这人也许就在现场

00:03:31.072 --> 00:03:32.464
Whoa!
这人也许就在现场

00:03:32.508 --> 00:03:34.641
Although, let's not
kid ourselves.
不过，我们也别自欺欺人了

00:03:34.684 --> 00:03:39.515
Truly, the only men for this job
are Kevin and his Minions!
确实能胜任的是凯文和他的伙伴们！

00:03:39.558 --> 00:03:42.213
[ Gasps ]Ten times the evil
in half the package!
小小的外表隐藏了十倍的威力！

00:03:42.257 --> 00:03:44.651
I am just in awe!
我很震惊！

00:03:44.694 --> 00:03:46.609
Let's hear it for Kevin.
我们为凯文鼓掌！

00:03:46.653 --> 00:03:49.568
He saved his tribe!
他解救了小小兵团！

00:03:49.612 --> 00:03:53.660
[ Minions Chanting ]
Kevin! Kevin! Kevin!

00:03:53.703 --> 00:03:55.574
Kevin, Kevin--Hey, Kevin.

00:03:55.618 --> 00:03:57.098
Hey![ Groans ]

00:03:57.141 --> 00:03:58.752
[ Minionese ]

00:03:58.795 --> 00:04:02.233
So, how should we
do this?
我们该如何进行？

00:04:02.277 --> 00:04:04.932
Hmm? Oh.
我们该如何进行？

00:04:04.975 --> 00:04:07.586
You see this tiny
little trinket?
看到我手上的红宝石吗？

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:10.111
- Well, just take it from my
hand and you've got the job.
- [ Crowd Gasping ]
抢到了就是你的

00:04:10.154 --> 00:04:12.635
No big deal.
It's almost too simple.
[ Chuckles ]
轻而易举

00:04:12.679 --> 00:04:14.942
Uh--Oh, come on!
来吧！

00:04:14.985 --> 00:04:18.249
Don't be afraid.
Just take the stone
and get that job!
别害怕！宝石到手就成功了！来吧！

00:04:18.293 --> 00:04:19.990
- Come on.
- Oh, okay.
别害怕！宝石到手就成功了！来吧！

00:04:20.034 --> 00:04:21.775
[ Minionese ]

00:04:21.818 --> 00:04:24.212
That job is mine!
工作是我的！

00:04:24.255 --> 00:04:26.170
[ Snickering ]

00:04:26.214 --> 00:04:30.044
[ Grunting ]

00:04:30.087 --> 00:04:32.568
- [ Straining ]
- Now, go easy on me.
温柔点

00:04:32.611 --> 00:04:34.265
[ Yelps ]Whoops!

00:04:35.614 --> 00:04:37.921
[ Screams ]Love the costume!
我喜欢你那造型！

00:04:37.965 --> 00:04:40.141
[ Screaming ]
我喜欢你那造型！

00:04:40.184 --> 00:04:41.925
Oh![ Groaning ]

00:04:41.969 --> 00:04:45.276
- [ Minionese ]
- So cool!
好酷！

00:04:48.976 --> 00:04:50.412
Tim? Tim!

00:04:50.455 --> 00:04:52.109
[ Snickers ]
Whoa!

00:04:52.153 --> 00:04:54.721
[ Purrs ]Oh!

00:04:54.764 --> 00:04:56.635
[ Panting ]
Oh, no, Bob!
[ Minionese ]

00:04:56.679 --> 00:04:58.986
[ Panting, Shrieks ]

00:04:59.029 --> 00:05:00.770
Tim!Is no one good enough?
没人能胜任吗？

00:05:00.814 --> 00:05:02.816
[ Men Grunting ]

00:05:02.859 --> 00:05:05.166
[ Man Screaming ]Bob!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.299
[ Grunts ]Hi-yah!

00:05:08.343 --> 00:05:09.779
[ Groans ]

00:05:09.823 --> 00:05:12.869
[ Speaking In Foreign Language ]Tim!

00:05:12.913 --> 00:05:14.175
[ Minionese ][ Gurgles ]

00:05:19.833 --> 00:05:21.443
[ Dress Whirring ]

00:05:23.488 --> 00:05:25.229
Oh!

00:05:25.273 --> 00:05:28.145
Didn't my speech
inspire anyone...
我的演讲没有启发你们吗？

00:05:28.189 --> 00:05:31.540
to rise up
and prove themselves worthy?
我的演讲没有启发你们吗？

00:05:31.583 --> 00:05:35.457
All these villains and yet
I still have the... bear?
那么多恶人却抢不到我手里的小熊

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.199
Stuffed bear!
Why am I holding a bear?[ Crowd Murmuring ]
我为何拿着玩具熊？

00:05:38.242 --> 00:05:40.723
Who has the ruby?[ Bob Muttering ]
谁拿到了红宝石？

00:05:40.767 --> 00:05:42.681
[ Gagging ]

00:05:42.725 --> 00:05:43.857
[ Spits ]

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.033
[ Crowd Exclaiming ]

00:05:47.034 --> 00:05:51.255
Wow! Who--
Who are you, my...
你是谁，我的蓝衣王子们？

00:05:51.299 --> 00:05:53.605
knights
in shining denim?[ Groaning ]
你是谁，我的蓝衣王子们？

00:05:53.649 --> 00:05:56.347
[ Stammering, Minionese ]Yo!
你是谁，我的蓝衣王子们？

00:05:56.391 --> 00:05:57.871
[ Minionese ]Minions!

00:05:57.914 --> 00:06:00.395
That was incredible.
那真厉害！

00:06:00.438 --> 00:06:04.399
Behold! The last creatures
you'd expect to win the day...
看吧！意象不到的优胜者！

00:06:04.442 --> 00:06:06.575
have emerged
victorious![ Minions Cheering ]
看吧！意象不到的优胜者！

00:06:06.618 --> 00:06:09.404
Everyone,
meet my new henchmen.
为大家介绍我的新仆从，小小兵！

00:06:09.447 --> 00:06:11.275
The Minions!
为大家介绍我的新仆从，小小兵！

00:06:11.319 --> 00:06:12.973
Kumbaya!
为大家介绍我的新仆从，小小兵！

00:06:13.016 --> 00:06:15.453
Kumbaya!Kumbaya!

00:06:15.497 --> 00:06:17.891
[ Bob ]
Kumbaya!

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:20.241
Hey!
I know those guys!
我认识它们！是我开车载它们来的！

00:06:20.284 --> 00:06:21.851
I gave 'em a ride here![ Bones Rattling ]
我认识它们！是我开车载它们来的！

00:06:21.895 --> 00:06:24.158
Whoo-hoo!
我认识它们！是我开车载它们来的！

00:06:26.551 --> 00:06:28.075
Buckle up, boys!
系上安全带，男孩们！

00:06:28.118 --> 00:06:30.991
Next stop, England.
下一站，英国

